From e9d428e6c196b487188e3108a5a4bfb4944a1f13 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Usman Akram <102724070+UsmaNaman@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 15:19:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] macOS: Vulkan renderer via MoltenVK (local patch set)

- meson: Vulkan dependency on darwin
- vk: no external memory on Apple; display image read back and uploaded to GL texture
- vk: geometry shader optional; no-GS path (vtxPosNP, dFdx/dFdy depth, quads -> triangles)
- vk: forced 16x anisotropic filtering, alpha-aware border colour fallback
- rebuild-mac-vulkan.sh helper

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
